      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIaAtr">VIIa Atr</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwa þis ne gelæste, ðonne gebete he þæt, swa swa hit gelagod is: bunda mid XXX p̄, þræl mid his hide, þegn mid XXX scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone does not render this, he shall make amends as has been established by law: a householder shall pay 30 pence, a slave shall undergo the lash, and a thegn shall pay 30 shillings.</ab>
      </div>
